  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Fungus Cultivator, herbalist level 15th</p>\n<p>You yield fungus at rates normally used to describe staple crops.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> All fungus yielded by a cultivation pot is done so at the standard rate for herbs, save that a fungus' yield is still cut in half when using the bounty of nature green thumb ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Fungus yields at half the rate of herbs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
